        "original_id": "7460eba5-d690-52be-ae21-592868513869",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Keith Scholey, Alastair Fothergill\n- Organizations: Disneynature\n- Products: African Cats, Frozen Planet, Chimpanzee, Aliens of the Deep\n- Places: Tanzania, Congo, hydrothermal vents, East Pacific Ocean, Caribbean Sea\n\nFacts:\n- Keith Scholey co-directed African Cats for Disneynature.\n- Alastair Fothergill was the executive producer of Frozen Planet.\n- Keith Scholey and Alastair Fothergill also made Chimpanzee for Disneynature.\n- Chimpanzee was filmed in Tanzania and Congo.\n- Aliens of the Deep was filmed at hydrothermal vents in the East Pacific Ocean and the Caribbean Sea.\n- Chimpanzee and Aliens of the Deep were not filmed in the same locations.",
