        "original_id": "3783ffae-ef3e-54cf-bdc8-e0b87f43ea11",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Bears, Aliens of the Deep, African Cats, Frozen Planet, The Blue Planet, Planet Earth\n- People: Keith Scholey, Alastair Fothergill, Vanessa Berlowitz\n- Companies: Walden Media, Walt Disney Pictures, Disneynature\n- Places: Alaska\n- Topics: nature documentary films, television series production\n\nFacts:\n- The Blue Planet is an award-winning series released in 2001.\n- Planet Earth is an award-winning series released in 2006.\n- Aliens of the Deep was produced by Walden Media and Walt Disney Pictures.\n- Bears is a 2014 nature documentary film about a family of brown bears living in the coastal mountain ranges of Alaska.\n- Keith Scholey co-directed African Cats and Bears with Alastair Fothergill for Disneynature.\n- Frozen Planet includes executive producer Alastair Fothergill and series producer Vanessa Berlowitz on its production team.\n- The production team of Frozen Planet was previously responsible for The Blue Planet and Planet Earth.\n- Frozen Planet is billed as a sequel of sorts to the earlier award-winning series The Blue Planet and Planet Earth.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
